    "chunk_text": "I. The breeder farms must be registered with the Animal Breeding Division of the Department of Animal Production and Health, Peradeniya;\n\nII. Animals intended for slaughter, fattening, or breeding must be confirmed negative for African Swine Fever (ASF) by an authorized officer in writing;\n\n4. Admitting animals to affected farms\n\nI. Before restocking, the farm must obtain a certificate from the range Veterinary Surgeon certifying that the premises have been properly disinfected and are in compliance with the prescribed biosecurity measures.\n\n5. By virtue of, and in the exercise of, the powers vested in me under the provisions of the Animal Diseases Act, I hereby nominate the following officers as Authorized Officers for the purposes of Section 3(3) of the Act, to take action to prevent the commission of prohibited activities set out in Paragraph 02(1) of this Order, and to exercise the powers of an Authorized Officer under Sections 13 and 14 of the Animal Diseases Act for that purpose :-\n\n1. Director-Animal Health, Department of Animal Production and Health;2. Director-Wildlife Health, Department of Wildlife and Conservation;\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'10'03Part I: Sec. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.2025\n\n3A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
